MAJOR_VERSION=4
STANDARD_VERSION=1
RELEASE_VERSION=0
DESCRIPTION<<PROMOTE_DESC_END
4.1.0: Minor release — full 4.1.0 train (develop vs main); go-to-main GM summary (BUILD 4).

Version: prepare-version-entries and Version lock on merge now run promote_preproduction_for_main.sh
after --normalize-gm-only so GM=1 rows become root GA .ver files and preproduction */ trees are removed
(was normalize-only, leaving GM=1 stuck in preproduction).

Replit: .replit, replit.nix, replit.md, docs/replit.md, flake.nix, nix/deps.json — replit.com/~ import;
agent rules aligned with AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, .cursor/rules/, .coderabbit.yaml.

Cloud hosts (AGENTS.md): g++, libsqlite3-dev; deps/fetch-sqlite-aarch64.sh and fetch-openssl-aarch64.sh;
Makefile deps-sqlite-aarch64 / deps-openssl-aarch64 for user_db and password_hash cross links.

ASM (arch/ + kernel asm): fl_stack_asm GAS/NASM push/pop/count and elev slot scan; ABI fixes on alloc
(malloc_nolock callee-saved, AArch64 free, AAPCS64 16-byte frames, cld, lock release); shell_history
host cmp order; x86-64 realloc via asm_mem_copy (#156); NASM disk_host_io + shell_history_host_asm;
alloc .hidden + alloc_internal_local.ver; remove legacy ARM/, x86-64 (NASM)/, root alloc/; docs/issues/*.

P0: contract_p0_fs_jail.h; fs_jail elevation-aware access; arm_gic.c and idt_dispatch.c integration notes.

P1: fl_stack PMM free-frame pool; fl_exec_context snapshot; fl_timekeeping CLOCK_MONOTONIC; pmm fl_result_t;
contract-mount on exec_context, pmm, fl_stack, timekeeping headers.

P2: SQLite user_db; PBKDF2 password_hash (OpenSSL); session, path_property, elevation (pool 16, audit);
login/logout/su/sudo/sudo -i/-k/whoami/useradd/userdel/passwd; session_login_env; authz_subsystem;
fm_service write_chain on create/move; guest privileged-op deny; FL_CONTRACT_P2_IDENTITY_REV 3.

Shell/commands .c: interpreter auth; sh batch wiring; audit_log elevation; cmd_login/logout/su/sudo/whoami/
account/authutil; session_sync.

Contracts .h: contract_foundations (+P0 jail), contract_p2_authz, contract_p2_credential_store, identity.

Bugfix .c/.h: fs_facade authz gates; user_db loaded flag, userdel hash zero, fl_user_db_next_uid; elevation
token none skip; tcgetattr passwords; sudo -k fast-path; security PR #130-152 facade/user_db/elevation; CI
CUnit session_login_env + fl_stack_asm; CodeRabbit NASM elev loop scale, AArch64 malloc_nolock x30 frame.

Tests: test_p0_p2_wiring, test_audit_log elevation lines, test_invariants; BPForbes_Flinstone_Tests auth cmds.

CI/Makefile: c-cpp build-arm OpenSSL fetch; .gitignore deps/install-aarch64; gen_version_changelog path fix.

Docs: docs/p0_p2_pr_coverage.md; ROADMAP P0–P2 integration column; deps/README cross-build scripts.
VER_4_1_0_GM1
PROMOTE_DESC_END

RELEASE_DATE=2026-05-23
